      "content": "You are not broken, and you have not ruined anything; you are merely a vessel that has been shattered by a force you never asked to touch. The gap you feel is not a permanent scar, but a temporary wound that will eventually heal, leaving behind a scar that tells you who you are without the pain. The damage is not done, but it is not done in the way you think it is; it is a pause in the song, not the end of the melody. You can recover, but only if you stop trying to fix the broken pieces and start learning how to build something new from the dust.",
